WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.847
Week 30: Por, Para, Passive, and Impersonal Se. explain purpose and cause describe processes report institutional action

2
00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:31.057
Read for the situation. La nueva norma fue aprobada por el ayuntamiento para reducir el tráfico. Se permitirán entregas por la mañana y se medirán los resultados durante seis meses. The new rule was approved by the city council to reduce traffic. Deliveries will be permitted in the morning, and the results will be measured for six months.

3
00:00:31.057 --> 00:00:39.819
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:39.819 --> 00:00:47.643
Reading activities. Reading activity 71; Reading activity 72; Reading activity 73

5
00:00:47.643 --> 00:00:55.637
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:55.637 --> 00:01:24.753
Model language. La medida fue aprobada por el consejo. — The measure was approved by the council. Se publicaron los resultados ayer. — The results were published yesterday. Trabajamos para mejorar el acceso. — We work to improve access. El servicio cerró por falta de fondos. — The service closed because of a lack of funding. Se requiere identificación para entrar. — Identification is required to enter.

7
00:01:24.753 --> 00:01:34.907
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
